  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After some testing, with different avatars and controller types, (with friends) the fingers on all avatars, even when put into legacy mode, seem to be horizontally bent, not in the direction the fingers curl but to the side. If I try point at something, or my friends, the fingers are a good distance off from the direction we are pointing. After talking with support and testing everything they have said, I can safely say it is not an avatar issue but a new input 2.0 issue. \n\nI am using a valve index with valve knuckles, my friends are on quest 2 and 3 with the updated virtual desktop. Which they also have issues with some buttons associated with the thumb not reacting correctly.\n\nI thank you for your development and improvement and wish you luck in resolving this.\n\nMany thanks, Coppsu.",
